  One template drives every pSEO landing page, keyed on page.handle.
  To activate a page: Admin → Pages → Add page → set the handle below,
  assign theme template "pseo", paste the SEO title/description provided.
  Pages render ONLY real available products, pulled dynamically by tag/vendor —
  no hard-coded product IDs, sold items excluded automatically.

  2026-08-13: the H1 follows the Admin page title and verified shipping is
  20 MAD inside Marrakech / 40 MAD outside Marrakech,
  and parent links point at the canonical brand-* collections.
  See snippets/lbass-pseo-h1.liquid for the full rationale.
{% endcomment %}

